# Send only the files needed to build the application, excluding local credentials.
*
!Dockerfile
!uv.lock
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!login_setup.py
!src/
!src/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
# src/** is re-included wholesale above, so anything that lands inside it
# ships in the image. These are untracked locally and so are invisible in a
# git diff, but .dockerignore governs the build context, not .gitignore.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/.env*
**/*.pickle
**/*.session
**/.monarch-mcp-server
